    "title": "⚾ Nickerson falls to Ellis in 3A regional opener - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago ELLIS, Kan. — No. 13 Nickerson saw its season come to an end Wednesday with a 10-0 loss to No. 4 Ellis in a Class 3A baseball regional opener. The Panthers finished the season 9-18. Ellis improved to 17-8 and will host No. 5 Holcomb in next Tuesday’s regional semifinal. Holcomb advanced with a 10-0 win over No. 12 Sylvan-Lucas. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
